Something like this (you could put the logic in a function to make it pipey) seems to work. Note it will fail if first entry is NA

while(any(is.na <http://is.na>(output_expanded$N))){
  theNA <- min(which(is.na <http://is.na>(output_expanded$N)))
  output_expanded$N[theNA] <- output_expanded$N[theNA-1]
}

