Also, I don't know what your requirements are, but many people feel
that pie charts generally don't represent data in the most-effective
way.  For instance:

https://blogs.oracle.com/experience/entry/countdown_of_top_10_reasons_to_never_ever_use_a_pie_chart

But there are counter arguments:

http://speakingppt.com/2013/03/18/why-tufte-is-flat-out-wrong-about-pie-charts/

-- Mike

