If I am trying to fix things like axis titles, annotations, etc on a graph, sometimes it is easier to just export the pdf and edit the titles in a graphics program that has a better graphical user interface (such as photoshop, inkscape, imagej, or even paint). Especially if you are trying to get it done fast!

