The code you have there to plot it sounds like you are plotting the output of your prediction(which is a list with a bunch of stuff in it), against the mean, which is part of the prediction. What exactly do you want to plot? I would want to plot the predicted values against the factor levels of the variables. Kinda like this:

plot(SL.YL_seq~pred.mean_SL.YL,type="p",col="blue",lwd=2,ylim = c(0.78,1.25))

Then you would have to put the error bars on, but I haven't experimented with error bars in base graphics that much.

