Can you include some of your data and your model? It is difficult to figure out exactly how to work it without code that we can run.

Are you looking for more than two values? I don't think that will work. Because you only have two factor levels, you will only have ever get two predictions if you hold all the other variables constant. If you want more predictions, you can try varying the other predictor variables at the two different levels of your factor. Are there any interaction terms in your model?

